	Tooltip: ""
}

Photographer: {
	DisplayName: Photographer
	Name.0: Iris
	Entry: The Photographer travels across the world in search of the perfect photos to add to their collection, selling misprints and old cameras to get by.

	Chat: {
		First: Oh! Hey there, I'm not sure if we've met before..? Well, um, I'm a photographer. I'm sort of new around here; the scenery really captivated me though, haha. Oh! I almost forgot... You can call me {NPCFirstName_Rosemary/Photographer}!

		Generic: {
			0: Take a look at these pictures I got! ... If you want to, of course.
			1: ... Oh, didn't, um, see you there. Need more lens wipes again?
			2: I wonder... would any of your friends be interested in a photoshoot..?
			3: This whole island is soo pretty... You really need to stop and take in the scenery sometimes.
			4: You know, um, back home... Well, there was nothing interesting to look at! I really can't appreciate this place enough.
			5: There are some really powerful tricks in photography; no one really tells you about them... So I don't really know them either.
			6: Wait wait wait shh... Sorry, I really couldn't miss that. Anyways, hi!
			7: Call me weird for this but... I like making these camera filters, when in reality, I don't actually... Use them... I prefer authenticity!
		}

		Forest: {
			0: Hey traveller, was just amiring the quiet forest; I even snapped a few good photos for my collection!
			1: Nice day for some pictures of the flower fields on this island.
			2: The sunflowers here are alot taller than the ones back up north, it's hard to get a pcture from a good angle!
		}

		Tundra: {
			0: The daylight just looks stunning reflecting off of the snowflakes! A perfect shot for my collection…
			Snowing.0: Ugh I can hardly capture anything, my lens keeps frosting over!
		}

		Night: {
			0: Unfortunately stars don't show up too well on film, but I managed to capture a few good long exposures!
			1: Whoa! Traveller, didn't see ya there! Don't scare me like that, I may mess up this perfect shot!
			Forest.0: I can barely catch the moon from behind the treeline at this angle!
			Tundra.0: Hey traveller, can you believe it? Aurora Borealis!? At this time of year? Located entirely within this biome?
			FullMoon.0: Hey traveller, caught a nice photo of the full moon, I bet it'll look great fully developed!
		}
	}
}
